      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-e7fdmb",
        "spya-zajp75"
      ],
      "title": "Why the truth matters ethically",
      "gist": "Whether AI truly feels things determines what moral consideration it deserves, so clear thinking about artificial consciousness carries real ethical weight now."
    },
