        "spya-w8z40d"
      ],
      "title": "Soul Machine",
      "gist": "Rather than any disembodied soul or algorithmic mind, what truly matters is our embodied, living nature, which we must not trade away for machine fantasies.",
      "question": "What should conscious AI mean for how we see ourselves? (a closing reflection)",
      "sourceHeading": "Soul Machine"
    },
