      "range": [
        "spya-v98v5u",
        "spya-qwvjwn"
      ],
      "title": "Urgency without inevitability",
      "gist": "AI's transformation of society is real and urgent, but no coming age of conscious machines is inevitable, so clear thinking now still shapes what happens next."
    },
